  ('chiffchaff', 'Chiffchaff', 'Phylloscopus collybita', 'birds', 'A tiny olive-brown warbler named for its song; one of the first migrants to arrive in spring.', 'Woodland, scrub, hedgerows and parks', 'March to September; listen for the song'),
