  ('polecat', 'Polecat', 'Mustela putorius', 'land-mammals', 'A dark, masked relative of the weasel with creamy underfur; once nearly lost from Britain and now recovering from Wales.', 'Farmland, woodland edges and river valleys', 'Dusk and dawn; most often seen crossing roads'),
