  ('water-shrew', 'Water Shrew', 'Neomys fodiens', 'land-mammals', 'A dark-backed, white-bellied shrew that swims and dives for insects and snails, its fur silvery with trapped air bubbles.', 'Clean streams, ponds, fens and watercress beds', 'Early morning and dusk along clear, still water'),
